Article 13 If the person to be served has not signed to acknowledge receipt of the judicial documents served by the People's Court, but any of the following circumstances exists, service shall be deemed effected:
(1) The person to be served has mentioned the content of the served judicial documents in writing to the People's Court;
(2) The person to be served has already performed in accordance with the content of the served judicial documents;
(3) Other circumstances under which service may be deemed already effected.
